# Normalise all text to LF in the repository and in working copies.
#
# CI runs on Linux, macOS and Windows, and the `mixed-line-ending` pre-commit
# hook enforces LF. Without this, Git would check files out as CRLF on Windows
# and the hook would rewrite them on every commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets Git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
